% a year over the last five."],"people":["With about 9,400 employees, each generates about $1.0M of revenue, 2.0x the Consumer Defensive median, and revenue has grown 5.6% a year across its filed history.","That works out to $191K of free cash flow per employee.","CEO pay is $118K (0x revenue per employee), and compensation governance scores well (3/10, lower is better).","Stock compensation averages $7K per employee."]},"profile":{"v":"WATCH","conv":63,"head":"Watch: composite 45, above the 39 line, but it earns less than its cost of capital.","pros":["Composite 45, above the 39 line (gates 13/26)","Trades 30% below fair value of $203","FCF margin 18.4%","P/E 12.7x vs sector 17.5x","Operating margin expanding 1.1%/yr"],"cons":["ROIC 6.7% vs WACC 6.8%","Net debt/EBITDA 3.3x"],"flags":[],"need":["it earns less than its cost of capital"],"buy_below":172.88,"vc":{"base":203.39,"base_src":"dcf","bear":140.81,"bull":300.66,"alt_median":99.14,"n_alt":3,"gap":1.4819,"dispersion":0.1075,"level":"LOW","why":["DCF is 148% above the other models' median ($99.14)"]},"med":{"pe":17.5447,"ev_ebitda":10.0,"pfcf":15.3688,"pb":1.9293,"roic":0.1206,"gross_margin":0.3381,"fcf_margin":0.0601,"div_yield":0.0311}},"mc_quantiles":[104.94,127.9,140.81,151.22,161.47,168.66,176.86,184.21,189.78,198.08,206.15,211.86,219.67,230.17,241.26,252.98,263.16,280.78,300.66,340.26,419.13],"mc_drivers":{"growth":0.422,"discount_rate":0.514,"terminal_growth":0.041,"exit_multiple":0.023},"ticker":"STZ","date":"2026-11-20"}